{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y90nupkv","slide":1,"text":"Redesigned first page only; second-page comparison preserved. Visual priority: left current Query A with matched RGB/SAR and selected region r*, upper-right secondary partition controls, lower-right primary support cases. Pink represents query provenance; blue represents training-support provenance; neither is a damage class. Numbered circles are support rank, not confidence. Dashed boxes are missing real evidence. No artificial buildings, attention heat maps, predictions or values were generated. Region control images use the same crop and matched count/coverage. Q(:,r*) is assignment weight, not damage probability. Per-building local attention weights need layer/head averaging stated, colour bar and numeric range when filled; independently normalized weights cannot compare total support importance. Source ID, event, building label and retrieval score stay with each training support. Labels are not local damage labels. Exact retrieved IDs must be used. Query A links to second page, where predictions belong. Main architecture formulas/attention computation/database are deliberately absent. All elements editable."}
